 tado_local/api.py            | 136 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 tado_local/routes.py         |   2 +
 tests/test_event_watchdog.py | 149 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 289 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
